---
applyTo: '{{structure.backend}}/services/**'
---

# Services Instructions When working in service files: - Services contain all business logic —
routes call services, never ORM directly - Accept validated input types, return domain objects -
Throw typed AppError subclasses (NotFoundError, ValidationError, etc.) - Use Prisma transactions for
multi-model writes - Keep services focused — one service per entity/domain - Never import Express
types (Request, Response) in services - Always handle the "not found" case when looking up by ID
